ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nMary is a very strict English teacher, she has very high requirements for students' essays. One day, she is correcting students' English essays, and she says to a student named Huang who is not performing well, \"Huang, your essay is as mysterious as the revelation.\"\n\n[Question]\nWhat does Mary really mean when she says this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Huang's essay is exceptionally profound\nB. Huang's essay is vague\nC. Huang's essay is very engaging\nD. Huang's essay is extremely adventurous","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":7.096585233002974E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1b8d6006945d280042c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367928499,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:32:08","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"5d9a4ceebded4d1e8cf6ebdaee4e8606"}